// TODO: Define a class named Hero that protects a health-points invariant:
// current HP must always stay within [0, maxHp].
//  - Store current HP and max HP as private int data members.
//  - Add setMaxHp(int): records the maximum and starts the hero at full health.
//  - Add a const getter getHp() that reports current HP.
//  - Add applyDamage(int): lowers HP, but never below 0 and never above max.
//  - Add applyHeal(int): raises HP, but never above max (and never below 0).
